Z||000001||Standard||09-15-2000||03:01 AM||||Well here's all the "W" RPO codes.. no W82 or WV1 in here:<P>WS1 Option picks (group) (85-88)<BR>WS3 Option picks (group) (1986)<BR>WS6 Performance package, special<BR>WS8 Priced order acknowledged<BR>WS9 High mileage coupe (84)<BR>WU2 Fiero GT<BR>WV9 Package, value leader, (84-86)<BR>WV9 Package, value leader, (87<BR>WV9 Package, value leader, (88)<BR>WO2 Sport appearance package (88)<BR>W61 Option group #1 (1987)<BR>W63 Option group #2 (1987)<BR>W66 Formula option (88)<BR>W69 SE option "Special Edition"<P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 150,000 miles and counting!       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BURNOUT.gif">    <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker||||reg||1
